AddYoVault_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not authorized
│  └── it should revert with Unauthorized
├── when vault address is zero
│  └── it should revert with Registry__VaultAddressZero
├── when authorized caller adds a fresh vault
│  ├── it should mark the vault registered
│  └── it should emit YoVaultAdded(asset, vault)
└── when adding a vault that already exists
   └── it should revert with Registry__VaultAlreadyExists
